DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_54EC_6489';
<p>54ec_6489</p> <table style="border: 1px solid black; border-collapse: collapse; "><colgroup width="200"></colgroup> <colgroup width="100"></colgroup> <colgroup width="100"></colgroup> <colgroup width="100"></colgroup> <colgroup width="100"></colgroup> <tr> <th align='center' colspan='5' style='background-color: silver'>Data Table</th> </tr><tr> <th align='center' style='background-color: lightgray'>Phenotype</th> <th align='center' style='background-color: lightgray'>Expected</th> <th align='center' style='background-color: lightgray'>Observed</th> <th align='center' style='background-color: lightgray'>Calculation</th> <th align='center' style='background-color: lightgray'>Statistic</th> </tr><tr> <td>&nbsp;Yellow Round (Y&ndash;R&ndash;)</td> <td align='center'>90</td> <td align='center'>85</td> <td align='center'>__</td> <td align='center'>__</td></tr><tr> <td>&nbsp;Yellow Wrinkled (Y&ndash;rr)</td> <td align='center'>30</td> <td align='center'>29</td> <td align='center'>__</td> <td align='center'>__</td></tr><tr> <td>&nbsp;Green Round (yyR&ndash;)</td> <td align='center'>30</td> <td align='center'>32</td> <td align='center'>__</td> <td align='center'>__</td></tr><tr> <td>&nbsp;Green Wrinkled (yyrr)</td> <td align='center'>10</td> <td align='center'>14</td> <td align='center'>__</td> <td align='center'>__</td></tr><tr> <td colspan='4' align='right' style='background-color: lightgray'>(sum) &chi;<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;=&nbsp;</td> <td align='center'>__</td></tr></table> <br/> <hr/> <p>Complete the table and calculate the chi-squared (&chi;<sup>2</sup>) value.</p> <p><i>Even though not part of the question, ask yourself whether you would reject or fail to reject the null hypothesis</i></p><p><i>Note: answers need to be within 2&percnt; of the correct number to be correct.</i></p> 
PROMPT_54EC_6489
$tolerance = "0.04000000";
$answer = Real("2.04400000")->with(tolerance => $tolerance, tolType => 'absolute');
$lower_bound = "2.00400000";
$upper_bound = "2.08400000";
$inclusive_numeric_cmp = sub {
  my ($correct, $student, $ans_hash) = @_;
  my $student_value = $student->value;
  return $student_value >= $lower_bound && $student_value <= $upper_bound;
};
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{ans_rule(20)\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp(checker => $inclusive_numeric_cmp));

ENDDOCUMENT();
